window.CV_SEARCH=[{"u":"company.html","s":"company","t":["关于我们","About us"],"d":["云想亿创集团是谁、相信什么、如何行事，以及「云想亿创」这个名字的由来。","Who CV-Etron Group is, what it believes, how it acts, and where the name comes from."],"x":["以人为核，智能环绕 云想亿创集团相信，AI 的价值不在模型本身，而在它帮多少人把事情做成。我们把基础设施、算力、验证方法和资本连接放在一起，交到企业和创业者手里。 联系我们 我们的立场 可靠先于新奇 企业需要的是每天都能用的系统。我们优先采用经过验证的方案，把稳定运行放在第一位。 门槛应当更低 算力和 AI 能力不该只属于大公司。我们为中小企业设计用得起、看得懂的方案。 先验证，再投入 好想法值得被认真检验。我们用 AI 帮团队在投入重金之前，先看清需求是否成立。 与创业者同行 从第一个想法到第一轮融资，我们把经验、工具和资源带到创业者身边。 五条业务线 三条为企业，两条为创业者。它们共用同一套能力：AI、算力，以及把事情做成的经验。 企业级 AI 基础设施 为模型部署、推理和业务应用提供可靠、可扩展的 AI 基础设施。 了解这条业务线 中小企业普惠算力 灵活、划算的算力方案，让中小企业也能用上 AI、放手创新。 了解这条业务线 AI 商业验证 用 AI 做需求验证、商业模式测试和流程自动化，缩短从想法到市场的路。 了解这条业务线 早期创业融资对接 为 A 轮前的创业团队对接投资人与创投资源，帮助做好融资准备、支持早期成长。 了解这条业务线 赋能独立创业者 把 AI、算力与资本对接放在一起，帮助创业者和独立专业人士把专长与想法变成可持续的事业。 了解这条业务线 01 / 01 我们看重什么，如何行事 这些原则决定我们接什么项目、怎么交付，以及在两难时怎么选。 以人为核。 技术围着人转，而不是相反。每个方案都从使用它的人出发。 说清楚，再动手。 范围、周期和交付物在开始前写明白，过程中的变化及时说明。 小步快跑。 短周期交付，让真实用户尽早用上，再根据反馈迭代。 用 AI 的方式做 AI。 我们自己的流程就建立在 AI 之上，所以知道它在哪里有用、在哪里还不行。 对结果负责。 交付不是终点。系统真正被用起来，才算完成。 不夸大。 做不到的事直接说做不到，不承诺无法保证的结果。 集团信息 「云想」是点子在云上，「亿创」是亿万人一起创造。点子在云上汇聚，未来由亿万人共创。 中文名称 云想亿创集团 英文名称 CV-Etron Group 联系邮箱 sales@cv-etron.com ICP 备案 京ICP备2026070946号 有一个想法，或者一个想解决的问题？ 写信给我们","People at the core. Intelligence in orbit. CV-Etron Group believes the value of AI lies less in the model than in how many people it helps get things done. We bring infrastructure, computing, validation methods and access to capital together, and put them in the hands of businesses and founders. Contact us Where we stand Dependable before novel Businesses need systems that work every day. We reach for proven approaches first and treat stable operation as the priority. A lower barrier Computing and AI should not belong only to large companies. We design options smaller businesses can afford and understand. Validate, then invest Good ideas deserve a serious test. We use AI to help teams see whether demand is real before they commit serious money. Alongside founders From the first idea to the first round, we bring experience, tools and resources to the founder's side. Five practices Three for businesses, two for founders. They share one set of capabilities: AI, computing, and the experience of getting things done. Enterprise-Grade AI Infrastructure Reliable, scalable AI infrastructure for model deployment, inference, and business applications. About this practice Accessible Computing for SMBs Flexible, cost-effective computing solutions that make AI adoption and innovation accessible to small and medium-sized businesses. About this practice AI-Powered Business Validation AI-powered demand validation, business model testing, and workflow automation to accelerate the journey from idea to market. About this practice Venture Capital Access for Early-Stage Startups Investor connections and venture resources for pre-Series A startups, supporting fundraising readiness and early-stage growth. About this practice Empowering Independent Entrepreneurs Bringing together AI, computing, and capital access to help founders and independent professionals turn expertise and ideas into sustainable businesses. About this practice 01 / 01 What we value and how we act These principles decide which projects we take, how we deliver them, and what we choose when a choice is hard. People at the core. Technology revolves around people, not the reverse. Every design starts from the person who will use it. Say it clearly, then start. Scope, timeline and deliverables are written down before work begins, and changes along the way are explained promptly. Small steps, quickly. We deliver in short cycles, get real users on the system early, and iterate on what they tell us. Build AI the AI-native way. Our own workflows run on AI, so we know where it helps and where it still falls short. Own the outcome. Delivery is not the finish line. The work is done when the system is truly in use. No overclaiming. When something cannot be done we say so, and we do not promise results we cannot guarantee. Company information The Chinese name joins two ideas: 云想, ideas that live in the cloud, and 亿创, hundreds of millions of people creating together. Ideas gather in the cloud. The future is built by hundreds of millions of people. Chinese name 云想亿创集团 English name CV-Etron Group Email sales@cv-etron.com ICP filing 京ICP备2026070946号 Have an idea, or a problem worth solving? Email us"]},{"u":"contact.html","s":"contact","t":["联系我们","Contact us"],"d":["所有来信都发到同一个邮箱 sales@cv-etron.com，由真人阅读和回复。","Every message goes to one inbox, sales@cv-etron.com, read and answered by a person."],"x":["联系我们 所有来信都发到同一个邮箱，由真人阅读和回复。 sales@cv-etron.com 你是哪一种情况 企业合作 想在企业里部署 AI、解决算力问题，或者验证一个新业务。 写信谈企业合作 创业者 有一个想法想验证，在准备融资，或者想一个人把专长做成生意。 写信谈你的想法 媒体与其他 采访、活动邀请、加入团队，或者任何没有列在这里的事。 写信给我们 先把话写下来 填好后，我们会在你自己的邮件应用里生成一封邮件，由你来发送。表单不会把内容发送到任何服务器。 称呼 机构（可不填） 想了解 请选择 企业级 AI 基础设施 中小企业普惠算力 AI 商业验证 早期创业融资对接 赋能独立创业者 其他 想说的话 在邮件应用中打开 复制内容 接下来会发生什么 我们读你的来信 每一封信都由团队成员阅读，不经过自动回复。 约一次沟通 如果我们帮得上忙，会回信约时间，把你的情况问清楚。 给出书面方案 范围、周期和交付物写在纸面上，你确认之后再开始。","Contact us Every message goes to one inbox, read and answered by a person. sales@cv-etron.com Which describes you For businesses You want to deploy AI in your organization, sort out computing, or test a new line of business. Write about a business project For founders You have an idea to test, a round to prepare, or expertise you want to turn into a business of your own. Write about your idea Press and everything else Interviews, event invitations, joining the team, or anything not listed here. Write to us Write it down first When you are done, a draft opens in your own mail app for you to send. This form sends nothing to any server. Name Organization (optional) Topic 请选择 企业级 AI 基础设施 中小企业普惠算力 AI 商业验证 早期创业融资对接 赋能独立创业者 其他 Message Open in mail app Copy text What happens next We read your message Every message is read by a member of the team. There are no automatic replies. We arrange a conversation If we can help, we write back to set a time and understand your situation properly. You receive a written proposal Scope, timeline and deliverables are set down in writing, and work begins only once you agree."]},{"u":"index.html","s":"home","t":["云想亿创集团 - 以人为核，智能环绕","CV-Etron Group - People at the core. Intelligence in orbit."],"d":["云想亿创集团为企业搭建可靠的 AI 基础设施，让中小企业用得起算力，并帮助创业者把想法验证成生意。","CV-Etron Group builds dependable AI infrastructure for enterprises, makes computing affordable for smaller businesses, and helps founders turn ideas into companies."],"x":["以人为核，智能环绕。 AI 应当围着人转。云想亿创集团为企业搭建可靠的 AI 基础设施，让中小企业用得起算力，并帮助创业者把想法验证成生意。 公司 2026年11月23日 云想亿创集团新官网上线 新官网按研究、观点、承诺与公司四个部分重新组织，把我们做什么、怎么做、承诺什么说清楚。 站点结构 查看 联系 sales@cv-etron.com 阅读公告 公司 2026年11月10日 启用集团名称：云想亿创集团 「云想」是点子在云上汇聚，「亿创」是亿万人一起创造。新名称说的是我们想做成的事。 名称由来 阅读 关于我们 查看 阅读公告 业务 2026年11月8日 五条业务线，服务企业与创业者 从企业级 AI 基础设施到独立创业者，我们把业务整理为五条清晰的业务线。 为企业 3 条业务线 为创业者 2 条业务线 阅读公告 进一步了解 公司 关于云想亿创 我们是谁，为什么叫「云想亿创」。 承诺 服务准则 我们在每一次合作中如何做事的完整说明。 承诺 负责任交付政策 按数据敏感度分级管理部署风险的自愿框架。 观点 我们对 AI 落地的核心看法 为什么可靠比新奇重要，以及我们如何据此做事。","People at the core. Intelligence in orbit. AI should revolve around people. CV-Etron Group builds dependable AI infrastructure for enterprises, makes computing affordable for smaller businesses, and helps founders turn ideas into companies. Company Nov 23, 2026 CV-Etron Group launches its new website The new site is organized into research, perspectives, commitments and company, so that what we do, how we do it and what we promise are easy to find. Site map View Contact sales@cv-etron.com Read announcement Company Nov 10, 2026 Now operating as CV-Etron Group Ideas gather in the cloud, and hundreds of millions of people build with them. The new name says what we are here to do. Name story Read About us View Read announcement Practices Nov 8, 2026 Five practices for businesses and founders From enterprise AI infrastructure to independent entrepreneurs, our work is now organized into five clear practices. For businesses 3 practices For founders 2 practices Read announcement Learn more Company About CV-Etron Group Who we are, and where the name comes from. Commitments Service charter A full account of how we conduct ourselves in every engagement. Commitments Responsible delivery policy Our voluntary framework for managing deployment risk by data sensitivity. Perspectives Core views on putting AI to work Why dependable matters more than novel, and how that shapes our work."]},{"u":"practice-capital.html","s":"practices","t":["早期创业融资对接","Venture Capital Access for Early-Stage Startups"],"d":["帮助 A 轮前的团队做好融资准备，并在合适的时候对接投资人。","Helping teams before Series A get ready to raise, and introducing them to investors when the fit is right."],"x":["早期创业融资对接 为 A 轮前的创业团队对接投资人与创投资源，帮助做好融资准备、支持早期成长。 联系我们 适合谁 这条业务线适合 A 轮之前的创业团队。 准备第一次机构融资 产品已经有了，接下来要面对专业投资人的提问。 故事和数据还没理顺 有早期用户，但讲不清楚问题有多大、钱怎么赚。 不确定现在是不是时机 想先听一个不带立场的判断：现在融，还是再等一等。 我们做什么 融资准备 把故事、证据、商业模型和公司文件整理到投资人看得懂、查得到的程度。 投资人对接 在阶段和方向都合适的情况下，把团队介绍给投资人。是否投资，由投资人自己判断。 早期成长支持 融资前后，用我们的 AI 与验证能力，帮团队把产品和业务往前推。 我们怎么做 我们先看准备程度，再谈对接。准备不足时我们会直说，并指出差在哪里。任何准备都不能保证融到钱，我们也不这样承诺。合作中的做事方式见 服务准则 。 延伸阅读 本页所述服务不构成投资建议，也不承诺任何融资结果。 准备融资之前，先聊一次。 写信给我们","Venture Capital Access for Early-Stage Startups Investor connections and venture resources for pre-Series A startups, supporting fundraising readiness and early-stage growth. Contact us Who it is for This practice is for start-up teams before their Series A. Preparing a first institutional round The product exists. Next come the questions of professional investors. A story and numbers not yet in order There are early users, but the size of the problem and the way money is made are not yet clear in the telling. Unsure whether now is the time You want a view from someone with no stake in the answer: raise now, or wait. What we do Fundraising readiness We bring the story, the evidence, the business model and the company documents to the point where an investor can follow them and check them. Investor introductions Where stage and focus match, we introduce the team to investors. Whether to invest is the investor's own decision. Early-growth support Before and after a round, we use our AI and validation work to help the team move the product and the business forward. How we work on it We look at readiness first and introductions second. When a team is not ready we say so, and we say what is missing. No amount of preparation guarantees funding, and we do not promise it. How we conduct an engagement is set out in the service charter . Further reading The services described here are not investment advice and do not promise any fundraising outcome. Before you raise, talk to us once. Email us"]},{"u":"practice-compute.html","s":"practices","t":["中小企业普惠算力","Accessible Computing for SMBs"],"d":["为没有基础设施团队的中小企业选型、采购和部署算力，并随用量调整。","Choosing, sourcing and setting up computing for smaller businesses without an infrastructure team, and adjusting it as usage changes."],"x":["中小企业普惠算力 灵活、划算的算力方案，让中小企业也能用上 AI、放手创新。 联系我们 适合谁 这条业务线适合想认真用 AI、但不想为此养一支技术团队的公司。 第一次上 AI 团队已经在零散地用，现在想把它正式用进业务。 没有专职运维 没有人专门管服务器，系统需要足够简单，出了问题有人可以问。 用量还说不准 不想一次投入太多，希望先小规模用起来，再决定下一步。 我们做什么 按需选型 自有、租用还是共用，先看一段时间的真实用量再决定，不为用不上的算力付钱。 硬件代采与部署 需要自有设备时，我们代为采购、安装和调试，交到你手里就能用。 上手培训 教会团队日常怎么用、怎么问、哪些事不该交给它。 随用量调整 用得多了就加，用得少了就减，方案跟着业务走。 我们怎么做 中小企业的预算经不起试错，所以我们从小处开始：先量一段时间的真实用量，再谈买什么。涉及客户或个人信息时，保护措施按 负责任交付政策 执行；合作中的做事方式见 服务准则 。 延伸阅读 不确定该买、该租，还是先试试？ 写信给我们","Accessible Computing for SMBs Flexible, cost-effective computing solutions that make AI adoption and innovation accessible to small and medium-sized businesses. Contact us Who it is for This practice is for companies that want to use AI seriously without building a technical team to do it. Adopting AI for the first time People already use it here and there. Now the business wants it properly in place. No dedicated operations staff Nobody looks after servers full time. The setup has to be simple, with someone to ask when it breaks. Usage is still uncertain You would rather start small and decide the next step from what you learn than commit a large sum up front. What we do Right-sized options Own, rent or share: we look at real usage over a period before deciding, so you do not pay for capacity you will not use. Sourcing and setup When owning makes sense, we source, install and configure the hardware and hand it over ready to use. Getting the team started We show the team how to use it day to day, how to ask, and what not to hand over to it. Adjusting with use More when you use more, less when you use less. The setup follows the business. How we work on it A smaller business cannot afford expensive mistakes, so we start small: measure real usage for a while, then talk about what to buy. Where customer or personal information is involved, safeguards follow our responsible delivery policy ; how we conduct an engagement is set out in the service charter . Further reading Not sure whether to buy, rent, or try first? Email us"]},{"u":"practice-founders.html","s":"practices","t":["赋能独立创业者","Empowering Independent Entrepreneurs"],"d":["帮助独立专业人士和小团队创业者，用 AI、算力与资本对接把专长做成生意。","Helping independent professionals and very small teams turn expertise into a business, with AI, computing and access to capital."],"x":["赋能独立创业者 把 AI、算力与资本对接放在一起，帮助创业者和独立专业人士把专长与想法变成可持续的事业。 联系我们 适合谁 这条业务线适合一个人，或者两三个人的事业。 想把专长做成产品的专业人士 你在一个领域做了很久，想把经验变成别人愿意付费的东西。 独自创业的人 没有团队，每一件事都要自己来，需要 AI 把一个人的时间放大。 有主业、想先试一试的人 还没有辞职，想用最小的投入先看看有没有人需要。 我们做什么 从专长到产品 把你会的事拆开，找出其中可以重复交付、可以定价的部分。 AI 工具与算力 按一个人的用量配置工具和算力，够用就好。 验证与起步 先验证有人愿意付费，再找到头几位客户。 需要时对接资本 不是每一门生意都需要融资。需要的时候，我们帮你做准备和对接。 我们怎么做 一个人的公司，每一步都要省。我们只建议当前阶段用得上的东西，并且先验证，再投入。合作中的做事方式见 服务准则 。 延伸阅读 另见： 融资之前，先准备好这五件事 本页所述服务不构成投资建议，也不承诺任何融资结果。 想把你的专长做成一门生意？ 写信给我们","Empowering Independent Entrepreneurs Bringing together AI, computing, and capital access to help founders and independent professionals turn expertise and ideas into sustainable businesses. Contact us Who it is for This practice is for a business of one, or of two or three. Professionals with expertise to package You have worked in a field for a long time and want to turn that experience into something people will pay for. Solo founders There is no team and everything falls to you. You need AI to stretch one person's time. People testing an idea alongside a job You have not left your job, and you want to see whether anyone needs this at the smallest possible cost. What we do From expertise to an offer We break down what you know how to do and find the part that can be delivered repeatedly and priced. AI tools and computing Tools and computing sized for one person's use. Enough is enough. Validation and first customers First confirm that someone will pay, then find the first few customers. Capital when it is time Not every business needs outside money. When yours does, we help you prepare and make introductions. How we work on it In a company of one, every step has to be cheap. We recommend only what the current stage can use, and we validate before you invest. How we conduct an engagement is set out in the service charter . Further reading See also: Five things to have ready before you raise The services described here are not investment advice and do not promise any fundraising outcome. Want to turn your expertise into a business? Email us"]},{"u":"practice-infrastructure.html","s":"practices","t":["企业级 AI 基础设施","Enterprise-Grade AI Infrastructure"],"d":["在机构自己的环境里部署模型与推理服务，接入业务系统，并在上线后持续看护。","Models and inference deployed inside your own environment, connected to your business systems, and looked after once they are live."],"x":["企业级 AI 基础设施 为模型部署、推理和业务应用提供可靠、可扩展的 AI 基础设施。 联系我们 适合谁 这条业务线适合把 AI 当作正式系统来建设的机构。 数据不能外出 合同、病历、图纸、客户资料这类内容，需要留在机构自己的环境里处理。 用量大而稳定 每天都有很多人在用，按量租用已经不划算，也不好预算。 从试用转为正式 试用阶段的做法撑不住全员使用，需要按生产系统的标准重新搭建。 我们做什么 部署与推理 按实际工作负载选定硬件与模型，在你的机房或专有环境里部署，把推理服务调到稳定可用。 接入业务系统 把模型接进你已经在用的系统，让员工在原来的工作流程里用上它。 知识库 用机构自己的文档建立知识库，让回答有据可查，并且只对有权限的人可见。 运维与售后 上线后持续看护：监控、更新、排障，以及用量变化时的调整。 我们怎么做 先算工作负载，再选硬件。上线前，我们按数据的敏感程度确定部署等级和保护措施，用你的真实问题做测试，由你确认之后再上线。完整的做法写在 服务准则 和 负责任交付政策 里。 延伸阅读 另见： AI 系统上线前的一张检查清单 想把 AI 部署在自己的环境里？ 写信给我们","Enterprise-Grade AI Infrastructure Reliable, scalable AI infrastructure for model deployment, inference, and business applications. Contact us Who it is for This practice is for organizations building AI as a permanent system. Data that cannot leave Contracts, medical records, drawings and customer files need to be processed inside the organization's own environment. Heavy, steady use Many people use it every day, and paying by the hour has become both costly and hard to budget. Moving past the pilot What worked in a pilot will not carry the whole organization. It needs rebuilding to production standards. What we do Deployment and inference We choose hardware and models from the real workload, deploy them in your server room or private environment, and tune inference until it is stable. Connecting business systems We connect the models to the systems you already run, so people use them inside the work they already do. Knowledge bases We build knowledge bases from your own documents, so answers can be traced to a source and are seen only by those allowed to see them. Operations and support After launch we stay with the system: monitoring, updates, troubleshooting, and adjustments as usage changes. How we work on it We size the workload before we choose hardware. Before launch we set the deployment level and safeguards by how sensitive the data is, test with your real questions, and go live only once you have signed off. The full account is in our service charter and responsible delivery policy . Further reading See also: A checklist before an AI system goes live Want AI running inside your own environment? Email us"]},{"u":"practice-validation.html","s":"practices","t":["AI 商业验证","AI-Powered Business Validation"],"d":["在投入重金之前，用 AI 检验需求是否成立、模式是否走得通、流程能否自动化。","Before serious money is committed, we use AI to test whether demand is real, whether the model works, and whether a process can be automated."],"x":["AI 商业验证 用 AI 做需求验证、商业模式测试和流程自动化，缩短从想法到市场的路。 联系我们 适合谁 这条业务线适合手里有想法、但还没决定投多少的人。 有新业务想法的企业主与高管 想在组建团队、投入预算之前，先知道这件事值不值得做。 怀疑某个流程可以交给 AI 有一项重复的工作，感觉 AI 能做，但没人认真试过。 需要一个直说的外部判断 内部意见不一，需要有人拿证据说话，包括说「不成立」。 我们做什么 需求验证 把最关键的假设写出来，用最省的办法去检验：访谈整理、方案对比、可点击的样品。 商业模式测试 在投入之前算清楚钱从哪里来、成本在哪里，并让真实客户对报价作出反应。 流程自动化 找出重复、规则清楚的工作，交给 AI 处理，并保留人工复核。 高管顾问 为企业主和高管提供一对一的 AI 顾问会谈，也可以是较长期的顾问合作。 我们怎么做 测试开始之前，我们和你约定什么结果算通过。AI 能让验证更快，但它替代不了真实客户的付款和承诺，所以每一轮测试都要落到真人身上。结果不好，我们照实说。合作中的做事方式见 服务准则 。 延伸阅读 有一个想法，想知道它是否成立？ 写信给我们","AI-Powered Business Validation AI-powered demand validation, business model testing, and workflow automation to accelerate the journey from idea to market. Contact us Who it is for This practice is for people who have an idea and have not yet decided how much to put behind it. Owners and executives with a new idea You want to know whether it is worth doing before you build a team and commit a budget. A process AI might take over There is repetitive work that AI could probably do, but nobody has tested it properly. An outside view that says so plainly Opinions inside differ, and someone needs to argue from evidence, including when the answer is no. What we do Demand validation We write down the riskiest assumption and test it the cheapest way: interview synthesis, side-by-side offers, a clickable mock. Business model testing Before you invest, we work out where the money comes from and where the costs sit, and put a real offer in front of real customers. Workflow automation We find work that is repetitive and rule-bound, hand it to AI, and keep a person checking the results. Executive advisory One-to-one AI advisory sessions for owners and executives, or a longer advisory engagement. How we work on it Before a test begins, we agree with you what result counts as a pass. AI makes validation faster, but it cannot stand in for real customers paying or committing, so every round ends with real people. When the result is poor, we say so. How we conduct an engagement is set out in the service charter . Further reading Have an idea and want to know whether it holds? Email us"]},{"u":"practices.html","s":"practices","t":["业务总览","Practices"],"d":["云想亿创集团的五条业务线：三条为企业，两条为创业者。","The five practices of CV-Etron Group: three for businesses, two for founders."],"x":["五条业务线 三条为企业，两条为创业者。它们共用同一套能力：AI、算力，以及把事情做成的经验。 联系我们 为企业 企业级 AI 基础设施 为模型部署、推理和业务应用提供可靠、可扩展的 AI 基础设施。 中小企业普惠算力 灵活、划算的算力方案，让中小企业也能用上 AI、放手创新。 AI 商业验证 用 AI 做需求验证、商业模式测试和流程自动化，缩短从想法到市场的路。 为创业者 早期创业融资对接 为 A 轮前的创业团队对接投资人与创投资源，帮助做好融资准备、支持早期成长。 赋能独立创业者 把 AI、算力与资本对接放在一起，帮助创业者和独立专业人士把专长与想法变成可持续的事业。 怎样开始 无论哪条业务线，合作都从同样的四步开始。 写信 说明你现在的情况和想解决的问题，不需要准备正式材料。 一次沟通 我们把问题问清楚，也告诉你哪些事我们做不了。 书面方案 范围、周期、交付物和费用写在纸面上，由你确认。 开始交付 短周期推进，让你尽早看到可以用的东西。 不确定哪条业务线适合你？ 把情况告诉我们，由我们来判断。 联系我们","Five practices Three for businesses, two for founders. They share one set of capabilities: AI, computing, and the experience of getting things done. Contact us For businesses Enterprise-Grade AI Infrastructure Reliable, scalable AI infrastructure for model deployment, inference, and business applications. Accessible Computing for SMBs Flexible, cost-effective computing solutions that make AI adoption and innovation accessible to small and medium-sized businesses. AI-Powered Business Validation AI-powered demand validation, business model testing, and workflow automation to accelerate the journey from idea to market. For founders Venture Capital Access for Early-Stage Startups Investor connections and venture resources for pre-Series A startups, supporting fundraising readiness and early-stage growth. Empowering Independent Entrepreneurs Bringing together AI, computing, and capital access to help founders and independent professionals turn expertise and ideas into sustainable businesses. How to start Whichever practice you need, an engagement begins with the same four steps. Write to us Tell us where you are and what you want to solve. No formal materials are needed. A first conversation We make sure we understand the problem, and we tell you what we cannot do. A written proposal Scope, timeline, deliverables and fees are set down in writing for you to confirm. Delivery begins We work in short cycles so that you see something usable early. Not sure which practice fits? Tell us your situation and we will work it out. Contact us"]}];
